This directory contains a Korean translation of a 1,000-question / 658-passage subset of
2WikiMultiHopQA (Ho et al., 2020; https://github.com/Alab-NII/2wikimultihop).

- Source subset: obtained from the LinearRAG release on Hugging Face
  (datasets/Zly0523/linear-rag, subset "2wikimultihop", commit f7971bb84fe205d0c080df5f48b1393d9f580c68),
  downloaded on 2026-06-08. The English files are kept unchanged in _source_en/.
- Original data license: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).
- Modifications: all passages and questions were machine-translated into Korean with
  google/gemma-4-31B-it (scripts/translate_dataset.py). entity_consistency.json records the
  check that each answer string appears in the translated corpus (885/890 non-yes/no questions).

Please cite the original benchmark:
  Xanh Ho, Anh-Khoa Duong Nguyen, Saku Sugawara, Akiko Aizawa. 2020.
  Constructing A Multi-hop QA Dataset for Comprehensive Evaluation of Reasoning Steps. COLING 2020.
and the LinearRAG paper (arXiv:2510.10114), which packaged this subset.
